4
00:00:04,202 --> 00:00:05,404
Namanya inti ferit.

5
00:00:05,424 --> 00:00:06,905
Di balik cangkang plastiknya,

6
00:00:06,925 --> 00:00:08,345
isinya cuma cincin keramik

7
00:00:08,365 --> 00:00:09,723
padat yang membungkus kabel.

8
00:00:09,743 --> 00:00:10,837
Tidak ada kabel lain,

9
00:00:10,857 --> 00:00:11,632
