24
00:00:28,635 --> 00:00:30,324
yang ikut merambat di kabel.

25
00:00:30,344 --> 00:00:31,686
Di sinilah ferit bekerja.

26
00:00:31,706 --> 00:00:33,962
Ferit dibuat dari oksida besi

27
00:00:33,982 --> 00:00:35,014
